<title>POLAND: STOMIL FEB NET RISES TO PLN 5.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>STOMIL FEB NET RISES TO PLN 5.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.88 vs   5.74</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.62 vs   9.82</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.06 vs   9.00</p>
<p> Sales		   54.82 vs  44.10</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	    12.02 vs  10.08</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	14.73 vs  17.73</p>
<p> Operating profit    15.05 vs  15.42</p>
<p> Sales		  105.52 vs  94.94</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is Stomil Olsztyn SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
